# Workspace navigation history

Follow the project skill `.cursor/skills/add-workspace-location/SKILL.md`.
Behavior: `docs/deployment-plan/spike-3/navigation-history.md`.

- Committed places (sidebar, deep pages, master–detail selection, omnibar/breadcrumb targets) use `WorkspaceLocation` + `WorkspaceModel.go(to:)`.
- Do not set `selectedSection` or open/close/select as the sole navigation path.
- Do not use SwiftUI `NavigationStack` / `NavigationPath` for workspace place.
- Destinations apply `workspace.currentLocation` on appear/change; prune missing deep ids with `fallbackToSectionRoot()`.
